+<ul>
+<li><strong>Be Ready&nbsp;</strong>to slow down or avoid objects/other people at any time.&nbsp;</li>
+<li><strong>Stay Alert&nbsp;</strong>to what's going on around you, especially at trail intersections or where glades connect into trails.&nbsp;</li>
+<li><strong>Plan Ahead&nbsp;</strong>and ease up in slow skiing/riding zones, check uphill when merging onto trails, and give others plenty of room when passing.&nbsp;</li>
+</ul>
